OL,3,GNEWSACold War missile tucked away in a 
OL,4,Afield hides love story for man's late  
OL,5,Awife                                   
OL,7,FA 20ft-long Cold War era missile       
OL,8,Fperched on the back of a truck in a    
OL,9,Ffield has become a hit on TikTok - and 
OL,10,Frevealed a love story behind it.       
OL,12,FPhotos and videos of the striking sight
OL,13,Fnear Llangollen, Denbighshire, spread  
OL,14,Facross social media, prompting         
OL,15,Fspeculation, theories and curious      
OL,16,Fcomments from people wondering how it  
OL,17,Fgot there and why.                     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
