OL,3,GNEWSACold War missile tucked away in a 
OL,4,Afield hides love story for man's late  
OL,5,Awife                                   
OL,7,FBut for the man who owns it, the story 
OL,8,Fhas nothing to do with secret military 
OL,9,Foperations or preparations for war - it
OL,10,Fis about him using an unusual hobby to 
OL,11,Fhonour his late wife.                  
OL,13,FAdrian Hyde, 59, admits it has now "all
OL,14,Fjust snowballed and I've got carried   
OL,15,Faway" and has spent about #200,000 on  
OL,16,Fnumerous vehicles.                     
